Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: unicorn: bind CPU thermal trips to policy cooling

Bind every CPU sensor's existing 90 C passive trip to its cpufreq policy.
The driver registers cooling devices for policy leaders CPU0, CPU4 and
CPU7, so all sensors in a cluster must reference that leader. Retain all
existing trip temperatures and GPU cooling maps. Poll during passive
cooling so step_wise can adjust throttling without another trip crossing.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn-thermal.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn-thermal.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn-thermal.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn-thermal.dtsi
@@ -136,3 +136,148 @@
 			      <&pmk8350_vadc 0x44>;
 	};
 };
